ite-scope\">3.5.20</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ep.Hebr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.8</span> </span>: with <span class=\"lex-gram\">part.</span>added, <span class=\"gk\">μ. ἡμῖν λογισαμένοις</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Luc.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Charid.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">20</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὡς κακῶς βουλευομένοις</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phdr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">234b</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cri.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">50d</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">4</span> c. gen. rei only, <b class=\"lex-tr\">complain of</b>, <span class=\"gk\">οὐ μάχης.. μέμψει</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">199.3</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">εἴ τι μέμφῃ τῆς ἐμῆς ἀπουσίας</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Hec.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">962</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τιμῆς ἐμέμφθη</span> of her [neglected] honour (cf. <span class=\"gk\">εὐχωλῆς ἐπιμέμφεται</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.93</span> </span> ), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Hipp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1402</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">μ. τῶν γεγενημένων</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.109</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">5</span> c. <span class=\"lex-gram\">inf.</span> with <span class=\"gk\">μή, μ. μὴ πολλάκις βουλεύεσθαι</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">object</b> that one ought not.., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.42</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">6</span> abs., <b class=\"lex-tr\">find fault, complain</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Supp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">137</span> </span> (lyr.); <span class=\"gk\">ὅτι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">EN</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1162b18</span> </span>. in Law, <span class=\"gk\">οἱ μεμφόμενοι</span> the <b class=\"lex-tr\">plaintiffs</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">GDI</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4998</span> </span> (Gortyn).</div></div>"}